{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415770","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415770","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041577001:1":{"text":"おや？またひとり、偉大なる国王陛下がいらしたようですねぇ。どうぞ、以後お見知りおきを。","source_cn":"哦？又一位伟大的国王陛下，向您致以敬意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8B31832CAD6EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041577002:1":{"text":"国王陛下？国王陛下なんてどこにいるんだい？","source_cn":"国王陛下？这里哪儿有国王陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5833CC237D4B5B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041577003:1":{"text":"ローランド大帝がブライト随一の美男子だということは、前々から耳にしておりました。ボクがわざわざ声をおかけしたのも、そのお姿を一目見たかったからでして……","source_cn":"早就听闻罗兰大帝是耀光首屈一指的俊美男子，我特此前来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DE52E3437FBC62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041577004:1":{"text":"どうやらあなたは、美しいお顔よりも、そのずる賢そうなお姿で人前に出るほうがお好きなようですねえ？","source_cn":"原来比起俊美的容颜，您更喜欢以这副狡黠的模样示人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85BF3A33C83D0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041577005:1":{"text":"おやおや、そこまで言われると、さすがの私も適当にごまかすわけにはいかないね。","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你要这样说，我倒不好意思敷衍你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A916DE48025EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041577006:1":{"text":"これで満足かな？","source_cn":"这样，你可还算满意？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1BB5340D0A73183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041577007:1":{"text":"大満足ですとも！","source_cn":"满意极了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x669BB46177DE001D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041577008:1":{"text":"インドラに衛兵の募集を任せたのが悔やまれますねえ。でなければ、あなたに似た衛兵を何人か雇って、そばに置いて目の保養にできたのに。","source_cn":"如果不是卫兵招募这种事已经被我交接给了因度厄，我多少要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0A6BE5890D5D732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041577009:1":{"text":"つまり、先ほどのお姿は、ちょっとしたおふざけだったのですか？","source_cn":"所以，您刚才那副样貌，只是个小小的恶作剧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F156ABCF18CAB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041577010:1":{"text":"巧みな目くらましだと思ってくれればいい。","source_cn":"你就把它理解为一个巧妙的障眼法吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7622D117A279009F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041577011:1":{"text":"そうでもしなければ、数十年ごとに私の後輩たちが、あの手この手で私を見つけ出し、自分たちがどれだけ大変かと泣きついてきては――","source_cn":"不这样的话，每隔几十年，我的那些后辈们一定会千方百计地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4623734478164EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041577012:1":{"text":"私をブライトの王へ引き戻そうとするからな。","source_cn":"最终的目的一定是让我当回耀光的国王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD28137A6345961F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041577013:1":{"text":"ああ、その気持ち、よく分かりますよ。","source_cn":"哦，我完全理解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC859F75A70CAC49E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041577014:1":{"text":"秩序を築くことと、秩序を保つことは、まったく別のことですからねえ。","source_cn":"开创秩序和维持秩序可是完全不同的两件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x220D2E573D020365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041577015:1":{"text":"それに、ひとたびああいう生活から抜け出してしまうと、二度と戻りたくなくなるものです。","source_cn":"再说，一旦从那种生活里解脱出来，就再也不想回到那种生活里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE2DDA84A11464D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041577016:1":{"text":"むしろ、自分が逃れた厄介ごとに他人が翻弄されているのを眺める方が、趣がありますからねえ。","so